# This project currently has no required environment variables.
# Vite/Nitro built-ins (MODE, DEV, PROD, SSR, BASE_URL) are injected
# automatically — do not add them as Vercel environment variables.

# If you add a browser-exposed value later, prefix it with VITE_
# and set it in the Vercel dashboard for Production, Preview, and Development.
# Example:
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app
